#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""sentinel-scan-pkgbuild - static review of PKGBUILDs before you build them.

Part of omarchy-sentinel 0.1.0.  Standard library only, no dependencies.

Scans PKGBUILD, *.install and any local files named in source=() for the
patterns seen in the real AUR supply-chain incidents (CHAOS RAT, July 2025;
"Atomic Arch" npm dropper, June 2026) plus the generic persistence /
obfuscation / privilege tricks that have no business in a package recipe.

Exit codes: 0 = nothing (or only low), 1 = medium findings, 2 = high findings.
"""

